      "id": "packages_microservices_agents_lazy_optional_sdk_invariant",
      "label": "Lazy Optional Broker SDK Loading",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "rationale": "Broker SDKs are imported only inside adapter default loaders via literal dynamic import so installing one broker does not fail when other peer SDKs are absent.",
